        },
        {
          "height" : 13.2,
          "text" : "1 Introduction",
          "width" : 82.8,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 396.3
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "The slot was cut into a block of laminated board",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 299
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "and lined with a strip of thin brass so that the card",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 312.5
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "could not dent the walls. A sliding rail of known",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 326
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "height rests on top of the spacer, and the height is",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 339.6
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "read from a scale on the side of the block. The",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 353.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "block was clamped to the bench throughout the",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 366.6
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "trial so that the scale did not move between read-",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 380.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "ings.",
          "width" : 20.9,
          "x" : 306.1,
          "y" : 393.7
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "Paper models of railways need many small parts",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 418
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "of exact height. Rails, platform edges and signal",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 431.5
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "bases all sit on spacers, and a spacer that is too",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 445
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "thick by a fraction of a millimetre lifts a rail joint",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 458.5
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "enough to derail a light wagon. Most builders cut",
          "width" : 218.3,
          "x" : 70.9,
          "y" : 472.1
        },
        {
          "height" : 12.1,
          "text" : "spacers from card and fold them until they reach",
